{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115020","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115020/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115020/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115020/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115020","id":3820226570,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc69hiee","number":115020,"title":"Rendering: Fix `fixed_size` flag for mono vs stereo rendering","user":{"login":"Clubhouse1661","id":177586398,"node_id":"U_kgDOCpXA3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177586398?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661","html_url":"https://github.com/Clubhouse1661","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-01-16T04:06:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T08:55:51Z","closed_at":"2026-01-20T08:55:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115020","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115020","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115020.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115020.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes the `fixed_size` flag regression introduced in PR #110410 where sprites would grow when moving to screen edges in mono rendering, while preserving the XR stereo rendering fix.\r\n\r\n### Problem:\r\n\r\nPR #110410 changed the distance calculation from `abs((MODELVIEW_MATRIX)[3].z)` to `length((MODELVIEW_MATRIX)[3].xyz)` to fix XR rendering. This fixed stereo/XR but broke mono rendering. Sprites now incorrectly scale based on their horizontal position on screen instead of maintaining constant size.\r\n\r\n### Solution:\r\n\r\nDetect rendering mode at runtime using `EYE_OFFSET`:\r\n- **Mono mode** (`EYE_OFFSET == vec3(0,0,0)`): Uses `abs(z)` - depth-only scaling\r\n- **Stereo/XR mode** (`length(EYE_OFFSET) > 0.0`): Uses `length(xyz)` - full 3D distance\r\n\r\nThis satisfies both requirements: correct behavior in mono rendering and correct behavior in stereo/XR rendering.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\n-  Mono rendering: Sprite3D with `fixed_size=true` maintains constant screen size when moving to edges\r\n-  Code logic verified for stereo mode (uses same calculation that fixed- #108188 )\r\n\r\n### Files Changed\r\n\r\n- `scene/resources/material.cpp` - Added runtime stereo/mono detection in fixed_size shader generation\r\n\r\nFixes #114995\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115020/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115020/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}